12. Official resources — study in this order
These are the resources I recommend bookmarking. Focus on the concepts and hands-on exercises rather than reading every page end to end.









1. APIM fundamentals

Understand the gateway, management plane, developer portal, API configuration and service tiers.

Read Microsoft Learn — Key concepts












2. APIM policies

Study policy inheritance, JWT validation, rate limits, routing and error handling.

Read the policy guide












3. APIM architecture and networking

Review private connectivity, Application Gateway integration, backend access and enterprise network design.

Browse APIM networking and architecture documentation












4. Import and publish APIs

Practice importing an OpenAPI specification, configuring operations and testing a backend.

Read the API import guide












5. Terraform and APIM automation

Learn how to provision APIM resources and automate API configuration deployment.

Explore APIM configuration automation